  "prefLabel": "En 308.11 Quarterly Report of Equipment Theft, Sabotage, and Breaches of Security",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 308.11 Quarterly Report of Equipment Theft, Sabotage, and Breaches of Security. Each utility shall on a quarterly basis complete a report of equipment theft, sabotage, and breaches of security on Form E-37 dated 10/2024, available at the department’s website at www.energy.nh.gov, and file one signed electronic copy with the department.\n\nSource. #14101, eff 10-22-24, EXPIRES: 10-22-34 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 300)",
